<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Elan, Axogen to raise $90mln in public offer.</title>
<headline>Elan, Axogen to raise $90mln in public offer.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Elan Corporation Plc said on Tuesday that it had formed a new corporation with Axogen Limited which plans to raise $90 million through a public offering.</p>
</text>
